      "description": "Pay for parking, reserve spots, and skip the meter, all in one app. With 66M+ registered users across North America, ParkMobile makes it easy to park on streets, in garages, at airports, near event venues and stadiums, and across university campuses.\n\nParkMobile makes every parking experience effortless and stress-free!\n\nReserve Parking at Top Venues & Events:\nArrive ready. Reserve parking near top venues and stadiums in advance. ParkMobile covers major venues including State Farm Arena, Mercedes-Benz Stadium, Prudential Center, PPL Center, Toyota Center, Rocket Mortgage FieldHouse, Spectrum Center, Kaseya Center, T-Mobile Arena, and KIA Center, plus many more. Book ahead for NFL, NBA, NHL, MLB, and MLS games, concerts, and live events, and many more.\n\nFind Parking in 700+ Cities:\nFrom street parking to parking garages, ParkMobile works in over 700 cities across the US and Canada, including New York, Chicago, Miami, Atlanta, Washington DC, Denver, Dallas, Las Vegas, Philadelphia, San Francisco, and Toronto. Find and pay for parking in seconds, or reserve ahead for a guaranteed spot.\n\nBusiness Parking Made Simple:\n• Manage fleet and employee parking from one admin dashboard\n• Add multiple vehicles and drivers\n• Pay with a business credit card or ParkMobile Wallet\n• Separate work parking from personal in one tap.\n\nExpress pay: Automatic Camera Parking\n• Activate express pay* once you’re in the app\n• Enjoy automatic, hands-free parking every time!\n• Location cameras detect your vehicle as you drive in and out, starting and stopping your session automatically\n• No tickets, no kiosks, no lines. Just drive in, park, pay and go!\n\nOne App for All Your Parking Needs:\nUnlike other parking apps, ParkMobile combines street parking payments, event parking, airport parking, and business fleet management, with live activity updates, and guest checkout. ParkMobile is your ultimate parking companion, which also gives you directions back to your car with the ‘Find My Car’ feature.\n\nPark smarter. Wherever you're headed, ParkMobile gets you there.\n\nSave time, skip the line, and secure your parking spot!\n\n*How to activate express pay - https://parkmobile.io/parking/express-pay",
